1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,633
The dog did not know the way.

2
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:15,833
So he followed the rain, past the market, where every street looked the same.

3
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:22,133
Past the bridge, where the river kept its secrets.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,900
Past the hour when even the lamps forget your name.

5
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:46,367
Then, under all that cold, a small warm smell.

6
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,567
Bread. Wool. A door he knew.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,367
He was never lost. Only far.
